# This repository carries only the patch delta and the CI that applies it.
# Everything else in this directory is output from the October 2026
# investigation that produced the patches -- unpacked source trees, built
# debs, build and gdb logs, a local apt repo. None of it is needed to rebuild
# the package, so none of it is tracked. Keep it for reference or delete it.
/*
!/.forgejo/
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/patches/
